OL,3,GNEWSAResidents share memories of city's
OL,4,Aambitious housing estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FJoe Sheehan says his family has
OL,7,F"nothing but fond memories" of living
OL,8,Fon a futuristic, modern housing estate
OL,9,Fin Hull in the early 1960s.
OL,11,F"It seemed absolutely amazing," he
OL,12,Fsays.
OL,14,FBuilt on bold ambitions and modern
OL,15,Fideas, Orchard Park was designed as a
OL,16,Fmodel estate for a new generation of
OL,17,FHull residents.
OL,19,FBut not all of the promised amenities
OL,20,Fwere delivered when the new estate was
OL,21,Fbuilt.
